{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55632","headline":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 三十 · 延寿","name":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 三十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"何如深谷一遗人，宴坐经行不累身。\n废宅可嗟频换主，凋丛愁见几回春。\n尖尖石笑烟笼碧，点点苔钱雨洗新。\n堪笑古人非我意，居山多是避强秦。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"延寿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55632.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55632","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}